description.narrative:
The contribution aims to provide core support to TIACs ongoing efforts in promoting good governance and anti-corruption policies as well as securing the organizational development through the following objectives;
Objective 1: Implementation of TIACs regular work, which includes implementation of TIAC's new Strategy for 20252027 to bring policy and behavioral change through research, monitoring, advocacy as well as capacity building and empowerment efforts supporting the statutory objectives of the organization. Sub-objective 1: Policy and legislative change to ensure transparent and accountable governance Sub-objective 2: Behavioral change to enhance intolerance of citizens toward corruption Sub-objective 3: Outreach and awareness raising to influence the policy and behavior changes Sub-objective 4: Organizational development of TIAC
Objective 2: Assisting the Armenian government in the implementation of the National Anticorruption Strategy and Action Plan for 20232026, whereas TIAC intends to use the current window of opportunity for the promotion of democracy and good governance and more intensively contribute to the implementation of Armenias anticorruption reform agenda
